    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218830/extras/a2c0ef42ffb797c715c8fc2a296c5010.avif?t=1669852378\" /></div><br><br><br>Hello! Welcome to GrandTraveler World!<br><br>this game is 2D TopDown RPG Game!<br><br>and this game is not turn-based game!<br><br>You can Play with keyboard or Mouse!<br><br>protagonist is `WooJu` , `Wooju` have a dream, the dream is to be GrandTraveler!<br><br>GrandTraveler have strong magic and dynamic skill!<br><br>The continent he lives in is called Grancia.<br><br>A person who freely handles the four spirit magic(wind, water, fire, thunder) is called a Grand Traveler.<br><br>You go on adventures and find treasure.<br><br>You can find and defeat monster, elemental boss, another Grandtraveler boss, and you can get vairety items, quest in Gransia!<br><br>Gransia have a many cute, scary 2d monsters!<br><br>this Game`s Main stroy is  how `Wooju` becomes a GrandTraveler and Defeat GrandTraveler Ganurial!<br><br>Let`s start Grandtraveler!<br><br>Thank you!",
